WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.649
Open the explorer.

2
00:00:01.769 --> 00:00:04.706
Open Tools and select Profit and loss.

3
00:00:04.826 --> 00:00:09.203
Inputs from Position size define the hypothetical share quantity and entry.

4
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.434
Change the exit.

5
00:00:11.554 --> 00:00:17.789
Move the exit slider above the entry price and compare the potential gain with the planned loss at the stop.

6
00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:20.204
Test a losing exit.

7
00:00:20.324 --> 00:00:23.610
Move the exit below entry and read the negative result.

8
00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:27.422
These are planning examples, not predictions or actual orders.

